usage: diagnose_rust_gate.py [-h] --filter FILTER --output OUTPUT
                             [--prelude-filter PRELUDE_FILTER] [--plain]

Replay a selected Rust gate inventory, optionally under GDB; not a full gate.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --filter FILTER
  --output OUTPUT
  --prelude-filter PRELUDE_FILTER
                        run this original inventory first in a separate
                        process sharing the fixture image
  --plain               execute the recorded test binary directly, without a
                        debugger
